    "title": "Senate Committee Probes Government Influence in Tech Censorship",
    "text": "The Senate Commerce Committee on Oct. 8 examined the U.S. government’s role in censorship on social media. Posts were censored under the Biden Administration during the pandemic, and leading up to the last presidential election regarding the Hunter Biden laptop story, a committee report finds.\nSenate Committee Probes Government Influence in Tech Censorship\nA committee report found that posts were censored under the Biden Administration during the pandemic, and leading up to the last presidential election\nBy\n|\nPublished: 10/8/2025, 11:51:40 PM EDT",
